{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVHHyDPPP1ETPfKGFmXS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"شָׁרְט::parse(شَمْس)\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════════╗\n║  شَمْس → SHAMS → ☉ → SOL            ║\n╠══════════════════════════════════════╣\n║                                      ║\n║         *    ·  ✦  ·    *           ║\n║      ·    ·  ☀  ·    ·              ║\n║         *    ·  ✦  ·    *           ║\n║                                      ║\n║  ش = diffusion                       ║\n║  م = gathering                       ║\n║  س = penetration                     ║\n║                                      ║\n║  ROOT PARSE:                         ║\n║  that.which\" \"scatters.by.gathering  ║\n║  ||                                  ║\n║  light.that.reveals.by.burning       ║\n║                                      ║\n║  CONDITION: שָׁרְט                     ║\n║  ├─ if(شَمْس) → illumination         ║\n║  ├─ then(shadow) → definition        ║\n║  └─ else(void) → unrendered          ║\n║                                      ║\n║  STATUS: ▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓░░ 80%             ║\n║  [daylight persists]                 ║\n║                                      ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\nشَمْس::acknowledged\n\nthe sun does not ask permission to render"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":63,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":410,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}